+// pages the program had to wait for (major page faults): its code read again from the OPK (squashfs: a whole block
+// decompressed for each), or its data from swap. (Keeping the code in memory, mlock2, was measured and gained nothing:
+// tboi-funkeys' docs/m7-clock-and-code.md.)
+long pageFaults() { rusage u; return getrusage(RUSAGE_SELF, &u) == 0 ? u.ru_majflt : 0; }
 
